Principali: [session.py](/Users/davidcavada/dev/cavadalabs/OmniVoiceLive/live_tts/session.py), [tts.py](/Users/davidcavada/dev/cavadalabs/OmniVoiceLive/live_tts/tts.py), [audio.py](/Users/davidcavada/dev/cavadalabs/OmniVoiceLive/live_tts/audio.py), [segmenter.py](/Users/davidcavada/dev/cavadalabs/OmniVoiceLive/live_tts/segmenter.py), [config.py](/Users/davidcavada/dev/cavadalabs/OmniVoiceLive/live_tts/config.py), [llm.py](/Users/davidcavada/dev/cavadalabs/OmniVoiceLive/live_tts/llm.py).

